								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 320<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=778.msg7183#msg7183"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=778.msg7183#msg7183">Re:How not to app to a guild!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> April 21, 2004, 05:08:33 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I also found it amusing when someone who said she knew Ragz claimed he was just having a bad day. I checked the dates. &nbsp;He was a total asshat in his Apr 15th posts... and his Apr 16th posts... and his Apr 17th posts... and his Apr 18th post on another guild board. &nbsp;hmm.... <br /><br />In case you missed it, far down in the thread someone noted that Ragz had posted on Resolution&#039;s guild board. &nbsp;Resolution is the other big uber guild on FV and FaF&#039;s main rival. &nbsp;After he quit posting on FaF&#039;s board, Ragz posted once on Reso&#039;s board when they linked his FaF app thread. &nbsp;Now he wants to apply to Resolution. &nbsp; ;D<br /><br /><a href="http://www.resolutionfv.com/index.php?name=PNphpBB2&amp;file=viewtopic&amp;t=1497&amp;sid=06b04b0228875e1cf57a3b0bb9b8dc23" target="_blank">http://www.resolutionfv.com/index.php?name=PNphpBB2&amp;file=viewtopic&amp;t=1497&amp;sid=06b04b0228875e1cf57a3b0bb9b8dc23</a><br /><br />In other fun, a recent transfer to the Xev server introduces himself and his wife, but soon shows once again that all threads go straight to the sewer when you start comparing people to Nazis.<br /><br /><a href="http://b7.ezboard.com/fxevserverboardsfrm1.showMessageRange?topicID=1306.topic&amp;start=1&amp;stop=20" target="_blank">http://b7.ezboard.com/fxevserverboardsfrm1.showMessageRange?topicID=1306.topic&amp;start=1&amp;stop=20</a><br /><br />The fun doesn&#039;t really start until page 2 of the thread. &nbsp;On page one he&#039;s posting some stuff that I agree with (that having officers decide who gets all the loot is open to corruption) and some that I don&#039;t (/random for loot... bleh), then he starts sounding too abrasive about his views, and then he plays that Nazi card. &nbsp;sigh...<br /><br />Yes, I&#039;m bored. &nbsp;The Ragz thread is a gold mine. &nbsp;Grab the popcorn! &nbsp; ;D<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: April 21, 2004, 06:00:01 pm by Callon</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
